    "findings_zh": [
      "常态引擎加适配器中位数约 1 ms，实际松键到候选绘制前中位数约 35 ms，输入与单次退格接近。",
      "冷启动首次真实按键出现约 357–381 ms 延迟；单独分段计时主要耗在 Java 候选适配阶段，而非 Rime 按键计算。",
      "长按连删吞吐接近已上屏同一字母串，但组成拼音时有更明显的间隔抖动；不能据此宣称完全无延迟问题。"
    ],
    "cold_cause_inference_zh": "EnhancedHook.update 首次经 SelectionLearning 调用 LearningStore.state，后者同步读共享学习表和历史快照；与首次适配耗时约 381 ms、热身后适配中位约 0.3 ms 一致。尚未单独预载 LearningStore 做干预验证，故将具体函数归因为源码支持的推断。",
    "limitations": [
      "No completed same-device original Google Gboard Chinese-engine latency control: bypassing the Rime adapter left the native decoder waiting for its language pack. Native-inspect result excluded from performance conclusions.",
      "No high-speed-camera end-to-end touch-to-photon measurement.",
      "Fixed synthetic phrases, normal battery/USB conditions; not a general accuracy or all-app performance assessment."
    ]
  },
